# The production build's settings, committed so anyone can rebuild thurin.id from a deploy tag
# and get the identical CID (docs: Verify a deploy). Vite loads this file for `vite build` and it
# takes precedence over a local .env, so every deployed build uses exactly these values.
# Both are public by design: they ship inside every thurin.id page (the WalletConnect ID is
# restricted to our domains on Reown's side). Farcaster proofs need no key (kit 1.3.7). Reads default to the keyless PublicNode RPC (no key here).
# `npm run dev` doesn't load this file; use .env for development (see .env.example).

VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=60c0601595de43c783d873e7008f1413
VITE_RELAYER_URL=https://relay.thurin.id
